er from the air, with the beach parking lots and the streets of beach houses behind it","caption":"The concrete pier from the air, with the beach parking lots and the streets of beach houses behind it.","description":"Aerial photo of the Surfside Beach Pier, labelled, running from a wide beach into a green ocean, with parking lots and rows of beach houses behind the sand","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"NOAA National Geodetic Survey"},"creditText":"NOAA National Geodetic Survey, public domain","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (NOAA National Geodetic Survey)","license":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/USCODE-2023-title17/html/USCODE-2023-title17-chap1-sec105.htm","acquireLicensePage":"https://noaa-eri-pds.s3.amazonaws.com/index.html#2026_Pre_Event/EC2601a_OB_N_RGB/","isBasedOn":"https://noaa-eri-pds.s3.amazonaws.com/index.html#2026_Pre_Event/EC2601a_OB_N_RGB/","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"the pier at 11 South Ocean Boulevard, Surfside Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true},{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/buyers/no-hoa/surfside-beach-houses-from-the-sand-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/buyers/no-hoa/surfside-beach-houses-from-the-sand-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":900,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"Beach houses behind the dunes at Surfside Beach","caption":"Beach houses behind the dunes at Surfside Beach.","description":"A row of two- and three-story beach houses in blue, yellow and gray behind low dunes, seen across a wide sand beach under a blue sky at Surfside Beach","creator":{"@type":"Person","name":"BullDawg2021"},"creditText":"BullDawg2021, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons","copyrightNotice":"© BullDawg2021, CC BY-SA 4.0","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","acquireLicensePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Surfside_Beach_Shoreline.jpg","isBasedOn":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Surfside_Beach_Shoreline.jpg","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"Oceanfront, Surfside Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true},{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-where-to-buy/surfside-beach-pier-and-houses-2011-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-where-to-buy/surfside-beach-pier-and-houses-2011-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":675,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"The pier and rows of raised beach houses in Surfside Beach","caption":"The old wooden pier and the raised beach houses beside it, seen from a plane in 2011. Hurricane Matthew took more than half of this pier in 2016.","description":"The Surfside Beach fishing pier with a parking lot on one side and rows of raised beach houses on the other, seen from over the ocean","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"U.S. Geological Survey"},"creditText":"U.S","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (U.S. Geological Survey)","license":"https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/","acquireLicensePage":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","isBasedOn":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"The pier and the oceanfront of the Town of Surfside Beach (Horry County tax district 660), Surfside Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true}]}</script></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Before you offer on a Surfside Beach home, we check four things.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Whether it is inside the town, which side of the rental line it is on, its flood zone against the 48 percent rule, and its tax as a main home or a rental.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/?place=Surfside%20Beach">Ask about a Surfside Beach home</a></div></section></main>
